    <sec><title>Case presentation</title>
      <p>The proband (II-1) presented at 3 months with recurrent oral ulcers<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B1">1</xref>. Uveitis was not observed.</p>
      <p>Sanger sequencing identified c.1245_1248delTTTA (p.Phe415fs) in <italic>TNFAIP3</italic> (NM_006290.3), absent in both parents.</p>
